.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PKCS12_SAFEBAG_SET0_ATTRS 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm PKCS12_SAFEBAG_set0_attrs
.Nd Set attributes for a PKCS#12 safeBag
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/pkcs12.h
.Ft void
.Fo PKCS12_SAFEBAG_set0_attrs
.Fa "PKCS12_SAFEBAG *bag"
.Fa "STACK_OF(X509_ATTRIBUTE) *attrs"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn PKCS12_SAFEBAG_set0_attrs
assigns the stack of
.Sy X509_ATTRIBUTE Ns s
to a PKCS#12 safeBag.
.Fa bag
is the
.Vt PKCS12_SAFEBAG
to assign the attributes to.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn PKCS12_SAFEBAG_set0_attrs
does not return a value.
.Sh HISTORY
This function was added in OpenSSL 3.2.
